padai mathan perum kiLai thirunthiya athara kinjukam thanai uNarnthu aNi paNi nithampa(m) inpa sukamum thara muthir kAma paravasam thaNinthu:
 these women are the biggest army of the God of Love, Manmathan; after imbibing the tasty saliva oozing from their pure and reddish lips and enjoying the ultimate climax of passion offered by their genitals resembling the hood of the cobra, my delusion is over;
