paNic checchaith thodaic chithrap puyaththu ukrap padaic chaththip padaik kacchippathic chokkap perumALE.:
 You wear the vetchi garland as an ornament around Your broad shoulder upon which You hold the powerful weapon, namely the spear, Oh Lord! You are seated in KAncheepuram, Oh Handsome and Great One!

Alam vaiththa vizhicchikaL siththasan Akamak kalai katRa samarththikaL:
